id: DRAFT-geojson-cpp-0.5.1-mapbox-geometry-value-sharedptr-abi
trigger_tool: conan|cxx
phase: building
error_signature: no matching member function for call to 'is'|no matching member function for call to 'get'|variable 'valueObject' with type 'auto \*' has incompatible initializer|no matching function for call to object of type 'mapbox::geojson::to_value'
severity: 3
category: compat, headers, build-system, conan, cxx
match_keywords: mapbox, geojson, feature, value, shared_ptr, const_array_ptr_type, const_object_ptr_type, recursive_wrapper, variant, getArray, getObject
title: 旧版 mapbox feature::value 按值访问器与 mapbox-geometry 2.x shared_ptr 语义不兼容的适配迁移
root_cause: geojson-cpp 0.5.1 面向旧版 mapbox-geometry（value 按值存 std::vector/unordered_map，variant is<T>()/get<T>() 可直用），而 ohpcd 已发布的 mapbox-geometry/2.0.3 将 value_base 的数组/对象改为 std::shared_ptr<std::vector<value>>/std::shared_ptr<std::unordered_map>（const_array_ptr_type/const_object_ptr_type），旧代码的 val.is<value::array_type>()、auto *valueObject = getObject()、to_value 访问器按值形参与 recursive_wrapper 断言全部失效
affected_scope: 任何消费 mapbox feature.hpp value 且按旧按值 API 编写的 C++ 库，链接到 mapbox-geometry 2.x 时编译失败
verification_cmd: conan create 通过 G2；build() 内上游 test_geojson(16)/test_geojson_value(14) 全过；test_package 消费者 4 断言过
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: mapbox-value-sharedptr-accessor-migration
rec_description: 对源码做最小访问器迁移：数组/对象存在性判断改用 val.getArray()/val.getObject() != nullptr；解引用 shared_ptr 取内容；to_value/convert 访问器形参改接 const_array_ptr_type/const_object_ptr_type；test.cpp 中旧 recursive_wrapper<values>/get<values> 断言改用 getArray()/getObject() 访问器（断言语义不变）
rec_command: patches/0001-adapt-mapbox-geometry-2-value-abi.patch：改 include/mapbox/geojson_value_impl.hpp、include/mapbox/geojson_impl.hpp、test/test.cpp 三处访问器
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: pin-old-mapbox-geometry
fallback_description: 若 registry 有旧版 mapbox-geometry（按值 value 语义）可改为固定旧依赖版本，但 ohpcd 仅有 2.0.3，不可行；必须迁移访问器
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: val\.is<value::array_type>\(\)|\.get<values>\(\)|recursive_wrapper<values>
forbid_1_reason: 旧按值 variant 类型在 mapbox-geometry 2.x 中已不存在，保留必然编译失败
forbid_1_consequence: conan create 编译失败，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-geojson-cpp-0.5.1-mapbox-geometry-value-sharedptr-abi.md
last_updated: 2026-09-23
source_event: geojson-cpp/0.5.1 适配 G2 conan create 首错：mapbox-geometry 2.0.3 shared_ptr value 语义与旧访问器不兼容，补丁后全门禁通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: pending
